WEBVTT

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:09.426
A NETFLIX ORIGINAL ANIME SERIES

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.807
ORIGINAL WORK BY KOUSUKE OONO

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.811
PRODUCED BY NETFLIX

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:44.229
<i>At any toy shop, just say the secret code…</i>

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:46.481
<i>"You can't get away now!"
"Coming to catch you!"</i>

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:48.942
<i>And you'll receive a special DVD!</i>

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:52.153
This starts tomorrow
in limited quantities.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.615
So please, Tacchan,
I'll be at work, so can you go and get it?

00:01:55.698 --> 00:01:58.076
What? I don't think I can…

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:00.537
"You can't get away now!"
"Coming to catch you!"

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.871
What? Um…

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.749
Say it! "You can't get away now!"
"Coming to catch you!"

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.210
"You… can't get away now!"
"Coming to catch you!"

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:08.837
-Again!
-You're not getting away…

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:10.380
Huh?

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.887
"You can't get away now."
"Coming to catch you."

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:20.223
"You can't get away now."
"Coming to catch you."

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.725
"You can't get away now, we'll tie you…"

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.812
You won't find a better price!
Cabbages, 100 yen each!

00:02:25.895 --> 00:02:27.480
"You can't get away now."

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:29.566
-"Coming to catch you."
-Cabbages, 100 yen each!

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:30.567
"You can't get away now."

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.943
-"Coming to catch you."
-100 yen!

00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:32.861
"Coming to…"

00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:34.404
One cabbage, please!

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:35.321
Thank you!

00:02:35.405 --> 00:02:36.614
You're not getting away…

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:38.449
Oh, Tatsu!

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.285
Hey, listen to this.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:41.578
"Coming to catch…"

00:02:42.078 --> 00:02:43.913
-Come here, you punk!
-You're an idiot!

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.248
Give me back my money!

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.000
Can we have a moment?

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.710
Um, I actually need to tie up--

00:02:48.793 --> 00:02:50.003
Tie up what?

00:02:50.086 --> 00:02:51.421
TOYS A MAS

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:52.547
Excuse me.

00:02:53.256 --> 00:02:56.009
Are you…
looking for something in particular?

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.553
<i>Oh, no… What was it again?</i>

00:02:59.554 --> 00:03:01.431
Why you runnin'?

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:02.932
You wanna get whacked?

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.310
What…

00:03:06.269 --> 00:03:07.729
<i>No… That's not right.</i>

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.857
Wherever you go, I'll find you.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.110
I'll string you up
and chuck you into the ocean.

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:15.069
TREMBLING

00:03:15.153 --> 00:03:15.987
SWOOSH

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.990
"You can't get away now!"
"Coming to catch you!"

00:03:19.073 --> 00:03:20.575
Oh, there we go!

00:03:20.658 --> 00:03:23.536
"You can't get away now!"
"Coming to catch you!"

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.454
RUSTLE

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:25.371
POLICURE

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:29.208
Thanks for the help earlier.

00:03:29.292 --> 00:03:30.293
That was a close one.

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:31.669
No need to thank me.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.297
By the way, did you know?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.550
There's another shop where
if two people say the secret code,

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:40.011
they get a super rare Policure card…

00:03:40.094 --> 00:03:42.138
What? A rare card, you say?

00:03:42.222 --> 00:03:44.098
<i>Wow, Tacchan, this is amazing!</i>

00:03:44.182 --> 00:03:46.059
Sounds interesting.

00:03:46.643 --> 00:03:48.228
This time 'round,

00:03:48.311 --> 00:03:49.771
do you want to join forces?

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:52.732
Of course. That goes without question.

00:03:54.025 --> 00:03:55.652
STRIDE

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:57.362
-Do as we planned.
-Okay.

00:03:57.445 --> 00:03:58.613
CUSTOMER SERVICE

00:04:00.657 --> 00:04:02.784
Flying high in the sky, Justice Heart!

00:04:02.867 --> 00:04:03.743
Sky Police!

00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:06.204
Roaring waves, Justice Star!

00:04:06.287 --> 00:04:07.455
Cobalt Police!

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:10.166
-Crimecatch Policure!
-Crimecatch Policure!

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:13.378
Those two are crazy.

00:04:13.461 --> 00:04:15.546
I… I'm really sorry.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:18.091
Those items are now sold out.

00:04:18.174 --> 00:04:19.300
CRASH

00:04:19.384 --> 00:04:21.094
Hey! Stay with me!

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:23.096
Hey! Come on!

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:27.934
<i>The Way of the Househusband!</i>

00:04:29.852 --> 00:04:33.273
A friend asked if I could
look after him for a short while.

00:04:33.356 --> 00:04:34.232
His name's Kotetsu.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.943
Look at that face.

00:04:38.486 --> 00:04:39.445
PANT

00:04:39.529 --> 00:04:40.363
<i>-So cute.
-So cute.</i>

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:41.948
Kotetsu.

00:04:42.031 --> 00:04:42.949
Come here.

00:04:43.032 --> 00:04:45.076
Here, here. Good boy.

00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:46.828
PANT

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:52.125
SWISH

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:53.042
CROUCH

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:54.836
YANK

00:04:54.919 --> 00:04:55.753
STRETCH

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.131
What's up, Kotetsu?

00:04:58.214 --> 00:05:00.133
That road has too many cars.

00:05:00.216 --> 00:05:01.134
PULL BACK

00:05:01.926 --> 00:05:04.304
You've got guts! I like that!

00:05:05.596 --> 00:05:06.472
Goddammit.

00:05:07.056 --> 00:05:08.182
You're way too cute.

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:10.518
DING

00:05:10.601 --> 00:05:11.436
TATSU
SO DAMN CUTE

00:05:11.519 --> 00:05:13.271
What's the meaning of this, huh?

00:05:13.354 --> 00:05:15.773
Which hood is this dog from?

00:05:15.857 --> 00:05:17.025
What happened, Boss?

00:05:17.108 --> 00:05:19.152
I need more photos!

00:05:19.235 --> 00:05:20.862
Boss replied so quickly.

00:05:22.905 --> 00:05:24.073
Kunimi.

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:25.533
The Immortal Tatsu.

00:05:25.616 --> 00:05:28.494
SNIFF

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:31.831
SNIFF

00:05:31.914 --> 00:05:33.041
<i>-This is awkward.
-This is awkward.</i>

00:05:33.124 --> 00:05:35.501
That dog sure is hefty.

00:05:36.085 --> 00:05:36.919
Yeah?

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.589
And your dog is so round.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:42.341
-Can I pet it a bit?
-Can I pet it a bit?

00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:45.511
This dog gets your attention.
She's big, but she's friendly.

00:05:45.595 --> 00:05:47.805
She feels so nice and warm
when you hug her.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:50.933
Look at these fluffy, round cheeks.

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.894
And that sad-looking expression!

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:56.064
Hey, bring the car!

00:05:57.273 --> 00:05:58.149
SCREECH

00:05:58.232 --> 00:05:59.358
Get in!

00:05:59.442 --> 00:06:00.318
VROOM

00:06:00.401 --> 00:06:01.319
Hey, Kunimi.

00:06:01.903 --> 00:06:03.279
Where are you taking us?

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:04.572
Keep quiet.

00:06:05.073 --> 00:06:06.866
I'm taking you somewhere fun.

00:06:11.913 --> 00:06:16.834
PANT

00:06:17.502 --> 00:06:18.586
A new menu item?

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.798
I'd like more young people
and women to visit.

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:24.926
I thought you might have some good ideas.

00:06:25.009 --> 00:06:26.135
Good ideas…

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.721
It's not on this turf,

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:31.724
but I know a place
that has a mean hustle going on.

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:36.145
This is hurting my eyes.

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:37.855
Are you ready to order?

00:06:37.939 --> 00:06:41.609
The Honey Bunny Rainbow Pancakes
for me, please.

00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:43.319
<i>Yep, that's Tatsu.</i>

00:06:43.402 --> 00:06:45.113
<i>He jumps in fearlessly.</i>

00:06:45.696 --> 00:06:48.616
One Fruity Lil' Beauty Milk Sherbet.

00:06:48.699 --> 00:06:50.701
<i>Okay, so that's how you roll.</i>

00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:52.078
-Will that be all--
-Oh,

00:06:52.161 --> 00:06:55.832
-and a Chunky Funky Peach Juice Surprise.
-<i>What?</i>

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:57.542
Where did you find that, Tatsu?

00:06:57.625 --> 00:06:59.752
It's right there on the back.

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:01.420
-On the drinks menu.
-What?

00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:02.630
Oh, yes.

00:07:02.713 --> 00:07:05.091
You can make it a dessert and drink combo.

00:07:05.174 --> 00:07:06.801
-Combo, please.
-Combo, please.

00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:08.511
So your orders are…

00:07:08.594 --> 00:07:11.097
one Honey Bunny Rainbow Pancakes

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.724
and Chunky Funky
Peach Juice Surprise combo,

00:07:13.808 --> 00:07:16.519
and one Fruity Lil' Beauty Milk Sherbet

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:19.188
and Thick and Dreamy Cream Tea combo.

00:07:19.272 --> 00:07:21.816
Also, some plates to share.

00:07:26.737 --> 00:07:28.406
<i>Thank you, have a nice day.</i>

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.244
That's enough sweet things for a while.

00:07:33.911 --> 00:07:36.080
<i>-This is…
-Yes.</i>

00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:37.206
A new menu item.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.792
A lemon and honey-marinated
chicken sandwich.

00:07:39.876 --> 00:07:41.419
A chicken sandwich, huh?

00:07:41.502 --> 00:07:43.546
It's simple and unfussy, like this joint,

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:46.799
but the lemon and honey
add a touch of extra freshness.

00:07:47.842 --> 00:07:48.718
CRUNCH

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:53.890
<i>12th grade, winter.</i>

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:55.183
<i>A country town.</i>

00:07:55.766 --> 00:07:58.144
<i>A girlfriend going off
to college far away.</i>

00:07:58.936 --> 00:08:02.106
<i>You said we should break up,
yet you're the one crying.</i>

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.024
BUZZ

00:08:03.107 --> 00:08:04.358
<i>A big wasp on her shoulder.</i>

00:08:05.193 --> 00:08:06.027
COUGH

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.069
Are you okay?

00:08:07.778 --> 00:08:08.738
Drink this.

00:08:08.821 --> 00:08:12.074
Hot and creamy chai,
another new menu item.

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:14.035
Be careful, it's hot.

00:08:15.203 --> 00:08:16.078
<i>Yes.</i>

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.789
<i>I was in my twenties.</i>

00:08:18.873 --> 00:08:21.250
<i>In India, on a trip to find myself.</i>

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:23.085
<i>The Ganges River.</i>

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:26.214
<i>Brimming with energy
and the vigor of life.</i>

00:08:26.297 --> 00:08:28.799
<i>Stimulating, yet mystical,</i>

00:08:28.883 --> 00:08:30.801
<i>broadening my perception of life.</i>

00:08:30.885 --> 00:08:32.220
DROP, SIZZLE

00:08:32.303 --> 00:08:33.638
<i>Then I burn myself.</i>

00:08:36.307 --> 00:08:37.975
<i>I'm an old man now.</i>

00:08:38.643 --> 00:08:40.436
<i>And I've burnt the inside of my mouth.</i>

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.480
<i>Definitely going to sting tomorrow.</i>

00:08:42.563 --> 00:08:43.397
Sir?

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:44.774
Thank you, Tatsu.

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.943
Those were great dishes.

00:08:47.026 --> 00:08:49.111
I'm just going to have
a smoke at the front.

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:50.029
SWING

00:08:50.905 --> 00:08:53.533
Did I get the flavors wrong?

00:08:53.616 --> 00:08:54.450
CRUNCH

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:55.368
BAM

00:08:58.412 --> 00:09:00.706
<i>Wafts of gun smoke. Bullet holes.</i>

00:09:01.499 --> 00:09:03.167
<i>My vision stained red with blood.</i>

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:05.086
<i>Miku…</i>

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.797
<i>A big wasp on her shoulder.</i>

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.299
<i>Huh? Was there a wasp?</i>

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:16.639
Ouch.

00:09:16.722 --> 00:09:18.266
<i>My tooth hurts.</i>

00:09:19.684 --> 00:09:20.643
Hey, Masa.

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:22.562
Don't tell me…

00:09:22.645 --> 00:09:23.563
Is it a cavity?

00:09:24.146 --> 00:09:24.981
<i>Oh, crap.</i>

00:09:25.064 --> 00:09:27.066
<i>If Boss finds out,
it's right to the dentist.</i>

00:09:27.149 --> 00:09:28.651
<i>I don't want to go!</i>

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:30.069
Of course not.

00:09:30.152 --> 00:09:31.696
What gave you that idea?

00:09:31.779 --> 00:09:33.197
Well, just now,

00:09:33.281 --> 00:09:35.658
-you held your cheek and said, "Ouch."
-Oh, that?

00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:37.868
I got hurt in a fight yesterday.

00:09:37.952 --> 00:09:40.913
There were about 100…
or I guess, 50 people?

00:09:41.497 --> 00:09:43.040
You took on 50 people on your own?

00:09:43.124 --> 00:09:45.167
I'd say yeah, just from a glance.

00:09:45.876 --> 00:09:46.877
Masa.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.298
The longer you leave them,
the bigger they get.

00:09:50.381 --> 00:09:51.215
What?

00:09:51.799 --> 00:09:54.927
If you're hiding a cavity,
it'll be no joke later.

00:09:55.011 --> 00:09:57.054
I'm fine.

00:09:57.138 --> 00:09:58.889
I brush my teeth once a day.

00:09:59.473 --> 00:10:01.517
<i>Idiot, you think that's enough?</i>

00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:04.353
<i>You have to brush your teeth
three times a day after each meal!</i>

00:10:05.021 --> 00:10:07.106
<i>Brush for three minutes each time.</i>

00:10:07.189 --> 00:10:08.316
<i>And floss afterwards!</i>

00:10:08.399 --> 00:10:10.818
<i>Use an electric toothbrush
if that's easier.</i>

00:10:10.901 --> 00:10:13.279
<i>Be as thorough as you can.</i>

00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:19.994
If you're half-assed about it,
you'll lose your teeth to gum disease.

00:10:20.077 --> 00:10:23.581
Do you want to spend
the rest of your days with dentures on?

00:10:23.664 --> 00:10:26.000
We're going to the dentist
before it's too late.

00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:26.917
Boss…

00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:30.713
I don't think I've told you this before,

00:10:30.796 --> 00:10:33.883
but there's actually a reason
why I can't go to the dentist.

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:35.593
Once, when I was a child,

00:10:36.802 --> 00:10:38.971
<i>my mom, who was normally so strict, said,</i>

00:10:39.055 --> 00:10:41.474
<i>"Come with me, Masa,
I'll buy you some sweets."</i>

00:10:41.557 --> 00:10:43.601
<i>I got excited and went with her.</i>

00:10:43.684 --> 00:10:44.935
<i>She…</i>

00:10:45.019 --> 00:10:47.313
<i>led me straight to the dentist.</i>

00:10:47.938 --> 00:10:50.024
<i>I was in shock, and I kept thinking,</i>

00:10:50.107 --> 00:10:52.026
<i>"How could an adult do such a thing?"</i>

00:10:52.818 --> 00:10:53.903
<i>I was…</i>

00:10:53.986 --> 00:10:55.321
<i>betrayed…</i>

00:10:55.988 --> 00:10:57.323
<i>by my own mother.</i>

00:11:00.576 --> 00:11:01.577
What? Is that it?

00:11:01.661 --> 00:11:04.538
-No!
-Let go of that!

00:11:05.206 --> 00:11:06.499
What's wrong with you?

00:11:06.582 --> 00:11:07.541
SMACK

00:11:08.918 --> 00:11:10.920
C'mon, be a man!

00:11:11.879 --> 00:11:13.130
Okay, then.

00:11:13.214 --> 00:11:15.091
I'll go!

00:11:15.174 --> 00:11:16.801
KIMURA DENTAL CLINIC

00:11:19.095 --> 00:11:22.264
Please help him out somehow!

00:11:22.348 --> 00:11:24.517
Um… What happened?

00:11:25.559 --> 00:11:26.602
It's a cavity.

00:11:27.103 --> 00:11:30.481
Okay, can I have your health insurance
and patient registration card?

00:11:33.818 --> 00:11:34.777
Next, please.

00:11:36.362 --> 00:11:38.114
-Masa.
-Boss.

00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:41.534
I'll be paying my dues now.

00:11:41.617 --> 00:11:43.285
Are you okay? You're bleeding.

00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:46.247
<i>Masa, don't worry.</i>

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.164
WINCE

00:11:47.248 --> 00:11:49.250
<i>I'll be joining you soon.</i>

00:11:54.338 --> 00:11:56.674
<i>Can you see it?</i>

00:11:56.757 --> 00:11:58.968
<i>Peering out of the gap
between the woman's legs</i>

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:00.261
<i>is a man's face.</i>

00:12:00.344 --> 00:12:02.471
<i>I see it! That's so scary!</i>

00:12:02.555 --> 00:12:05.474
Hmph, that's mere child's play.

00:12:05.558 --> 00:12:06.434
So why are you covering your eyes?

00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:08.936
TICK TOCK

00:12:09.019 --> 00:12:10.396
BREATHES

00:12:12.648 --> 00:12:13.816
<i>I can't sleep.</i>

00:12:15.151 --> 00:12:16.819
<i>It looks like a face.</i>

00:12:17.486 --> 00:12:19.530
<i>Hey, was that door open before?</i>

00:12:20.156 --> 00:12:21.073
<i>This isn't good…</i>

00:12:21.157 --> 00:12:23.784
<i>Usually, counting something
makes you sleepy…</i>

00:12:25.119 --> 00:12:26.537
<i>One yakuza member.</i>

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.038
<i>Two yakuza members.</i>

00:12:28.122 --> 00:12:30.040
<i>Three yakuza members.</i>

00:12:30.124 --> 00:12:31.542
<i>Five yakuza members.</i>

00:12:31.625 --> 00:12:32.793
<i>One cop.</i>

00:12:32.877 --> 00:12:34.545
<i>Zero Yakuza members.</i>

00:12:35.629 --> 00:12:38.048
<i>Eight members of a gang.</i>

00:12:38.132 --> 00:12:40.551
<i>Ten members of another gang.</i>

00:12:40.634 --> 00:12:42.261
<i>One survivor.</i>

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:43.971
<i>This isn't working.</i>

00:12:44.555 --> 00:12:48.184
<i>Oh, yeah, they have
calming nature sounds for sleeping.</i>

00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:49.935
<i>There it is.</i>

00:12:50.019 --> 00:12:51.937
<i>Forest sounds.</i>

00:12:53.147 --> 00:12:54.815
<i>Rustling leaves.</i>

00:12:54.899 --> 00:12:56.400
<i>The chirping of birds.</i>

00:12:56.484 --> 00:12:58.360
<i>Yakuza digging a hole.</i>

00:12:58.444 --> 00:13:00.321
<i>That's not right. Let's change it.</i>

00:13:01.614 --> 00:13:03.032
<i>Let's listen to sea sounds.</i>

00:13:05.159 --> 00:13:06.243
<i>No…</i>

00:13:06.911 --> 00:13:08.454
<i>Goddammit, I can't sleep.</i>

00:13:08.537 --> 00:13:09.497
BREATHES

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.457
<i>Miku's out cold.</i>

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.791
COVER

00:13:13.375 --> 00:13:14.460
<i>I have no choice.</i>

00:13:14.543 --> 00:13:16.504
<i>Time to get the stash out.</i>

00:13:16.587 --> 00:13:17.421
SHOWA DELISH MILK

00:13:17.505 --> 00:13:18.464
<i>Before going to bed,</i>

00:13:19.048 --> 00:13:21.175
<i>there's nothing better than this.</i>

00:13:21.759 --> 00:13:25.429
<i>The milk warms the body
and the calcium calms the nerves.</i>

00:13:25.513 --> 00:13:26.764
<i>Now I can sleep.</i>

00:13:26.847 --> 00:13:27.681
No.

00:13:28.307 --> 00:13:29.642
<i>It's not enough!</i>

00:13:30.434 --> 00:13:33.103
<i>Let's take out the stuff
that'll get the job done!</i>

00:13:33.771 --> 00:13:34.647
<i>Melatonin.</i>

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.649
<i>Serotonin. Tryptophan.</i>

00:13:36.732 --> 00:13:37.566
SIZZLE

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.859
<i>I can't be half-assed about it!</i>

00:13:39.443 --> 00:13:40.277
<i>There we go!</i>

00:13:40.361 --> 00:13:43.822
<i>Salmon with creamy walnut sauce
and herb tea!</i>

00:13:44.823 --> 00:13:47.034
<i>I've gone and made a whole meal.</i>

00:13:47.618 --> 00:13:48.786
<i>Let's try it anyway.</i>

00:13:48.869 --> 00:13:49.703
CHOMP

00:13:52.206 --> 00:13:56.961
<i>The fatty salmon and the walnut sauce
together is so comforting.</i>

00:13:57.795 --> 00:14:00.422
<i>Hmm, I shouldn't really be
eating this before bed.</i>

00:14:05.636 --> 00:14:07.763
<i>Ah, I'm feeling sleepy…</i>

00:14:07.846 --> 00:14:08.722
CREAK, BANG

00:14:09.223 --> 00:14:10.057
BOLT

00:14:10.683 --> 00:14:11.517
PLOP

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:16.522
NOW I FEEL BETTER

00:14:16.605 --> 00:14:17.982
EPISODE 60
GIN'S WALK PART 4

00:14:18.065 --> 00:14:20.192
Hm? What are you looking at?

00:14:20.776 --> 00:14:22.778
-I was feeling jealous.
-About what?

00:14:22.861 --> 00:14:25.322
Flying in the air sounds nice.

00:14:25.406 --> 00:14:26.407
Well, I guess.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.492
It can get pretty tiring though.

00:14:28.576 --> 00:14:29.743
Black kites can be scary.

00:14:30.327 --> 00:14:31.328
Hey, Crow.

00:14:31.412 --> 00:14:34.206
Can you grab me
with your claws and try flying?

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.000
No way, that'd be tough.

00:14:36.083 --> 00:14:38.627
-My claws would hurt you.
-No, it'll be fine.

00:14:38.711 --> 00:14:39.920
Just once.

00:14:40.004 --> 00:14:41.630
Okay, but I warned you.

00:14:41.714 --> 00:14:42.631
Let's go.

00:14:42.715 --> 00:14:43.841
Ouch!

00:14:43.924 --> 00:14:45.217
Oh, sorry.

00:14:45.301 --> 00:14:49.054
God, that hurt!
Your claws went right in. Ouch!

00:14:49.138 --> 00:14:50.347
Am I bleeding?

00:14:50.431 --> 00:14:52.016
I only hopped onto you.

00:14:52.099 --> 00:14:54.685
Try and grab hold of
the scruff of my neck more.

00:14:54.768 --> 00:14:55.603
Yeah, okay.

00:14:55.686 --> 00:14:59.356
-Ouch! That hurts!
-Endure it! Just a bit more!

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.691
Stop! That's enough!

00:15:00.774 --> 00:15:02.151
Enough, I say!

00:15:02.234 --> 00:15:04.528
Ouch, that really hurt.
That freaked me out.

00:15:04.612 --> 00:15:05.654
What the hell?

00:15:05.738 --> 00:15:07.907
What? It's my fault now?
